  "id": "baked-peach-cheesecake",
  "name": "Baked Peach Cheesecake",
  "subtitle": "Creamy citrus cheesecake with peaches and a tender pastry base.",
  "description": "A baked curd-cheese cheesecake layered with orange-scented pastry and drained peaches, finished with a softly set center.",
